I've done some revision of the hobbit race based on feedback from
people in this newsgroup.  The new version of the patch has the
following changes from the original patch:

 * Hobbits may now be lawful or neutral, but not chaotic
 * Hobbits may no longer be priests, but may now be healers or knights
 * Hobbits start with a base luck of 1 higher than other races
 * Hobbit rangers get slings and flint stones instead of bows and
arrows, and their sling and dagger is at +2 instead of +1 to make-up
for the fact that flint stones can't be magical
 * Hobbit tourists get daggers instead of darts, only 1 of which is +2
 * Hobbits can fire sling ammo faster much like elves can fire elven
bows faster
 * Hobbits now start with only 1 dessert item, and only if not cavemen
 * Fixed problem where Hobbits could not be selected in the tty port
by using a capital "H" to select Hobbits

The patch may be found here:

